    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness in Reflection</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where the boundaries between worlds are erased and something sinister lurks behind the mirrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an abandoned village where time seems to have frozen. There are no people here, only silence and abandoned houses whose windows look into the void. But the strangest thing is the mirrors. There are no reflections in them, only impenetrable darkness. What is hidden on the other side? Why do you have this feeling that you are being watched? Solve the mystery of this place before it swallows you up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned village, look for clues and solve puzzles to discover the truth. Mirrors are portals to another world where the light disappears and something sinister lurks behind the darkness. Your flashlight is your only defense, but will it help you survive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness in Reflection</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where the boundaries between worlds are erased and something sinister lurks behind the mirrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in an abandoned village where time seems to have frozen. There are no people here, only silence and abandoned houses whose windows look into the void. But the strangest thing is the mirrors. There are no reflections in them, only impenetrable darkness. What is hidden on the other side? Why do you have this feeling that you are being watched? Solve the mystery of this place before it swallows you up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned village, look for clues and solve puzzles to discover the truth. Mirrors are portals to another world where the light disappears and something sinister lurks behind the darkness. Your flashlight is your only defense, but will it help you survive?</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Darkness in Reflection&quot; is a first-person psychological horror game where the player explores an abandoned village, uncovering dark secrets. Mirrors here lead to a world of darkness, hiding something sinister. Use a flashlight, solve puzzles and try to survive.",
